{title: No Lasting City}
{subtitle: Hebrews 13:14}
{key: F}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | [Am/C] | [Bb] [F/A] | [Gm] |
| [C] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The [Dm]high priest carries blood of ani[Bb]mals [F/A]
[Gm7]Into the holy place with [F]care
[C/E]But their [Dm]bodies are burned outside the [Bb]camp
A ritual beyond the air
[F]Je[Dm]sus suffered outside the gate
To [C]make the peo[Bb]ple holy and new
Through his own [F]blood [C/E]we are set [Dm]apart
From the old and fad[Bb]ing view
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
For here we have no last[C]ing city
[F]We look for [C]the one that is [Bb]to come
No [Dm]permanent home [C]in this world
Only [Bb]the prom[Dm]ise we have found
[C]For here we have [Bb]no lasting c[C]ity
We look for the one [F]that is [Dm]to come
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Let [C]us go out [Bb]to him out[Dm]side the camp
Bear[C]ing the disgrace [F]he bore
We join him in the way of [Bb]suffering
For [Dm]the sake of his love fore[F]ver[C/E]more
[Dm]Through him we offer praise continual[Bb]ly
The fruit of lips that confess [F]his name
[Dm]Do not neglect to do [C]good and share
For such [Bb]sacrifices please God's [F]fame [C/E]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Dm]For here we have no lasting c[Bb]ity
We look [C]for the one that is to come
No [F]permanent [C]home in this world
[Bb]Only the [Dm]promise we have [C]found
For here [Bb]we have [Dm]no lasting c[C]ity
We look [Bb]for the one that [C]is to [F]come
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
O[Dm]bey your lead[C]ers and submit [Bb]to them
They [Dm]keep watch over [C]your souls
They must [F]give an account to God
Let their work [Bb]be a joy [Dm]and not a burden
Do [F]this [Dm]so it may be to your advan[Bb]tage
For it is of no benefit to [F]you [C/E]
[Dm]Walk in faith and in obedience
Un[C]der the sky [Bb]that is so blue
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
For here we have no [F]last[Dm]ing city
We look for [Bb]the one that [C]is to come
No permanent home in [F]this world
On[C]ly the promise [Bb]we have found
[Dm]For here we have [C]no lasting c[Bb]ity
We [Dm]look for the one [C]that is to [Bb]come
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[C]For here we have [F]no last[Dm]ing city
[C]We look for [Bb]the one that [Dm]is to [C][F]come
{end_of_verse}

